    "breadcrumb": "수리전자물리학 \u003e Tensor analysis \u003e Calculus",
    "content": "1. Curl\r$$\r\\nabla\\times\\vec{f}\r=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\vec{u}}\\times\\vec{f}\r=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u_i}\\hat{u}_i\\times f_j\\hat{u}_j\r=\\frac{\\partial f_j}{\\partial u_i}\\hat{u}_i\\times\\hat{u}_j\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}\\frac{\\partial f_j}{\\partial u_i}\\hat{u}_k\r$$순환 기호는 인덱스는 하나의 항에 대응된다.\n$$\r[\\nabla\\times\\vec{f}]_i\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}\\partial_j f_k\r$$$$\r[\\nabla\\times\\vec{f}]_j\r=\\varepsilon_{jki}\\partial_k f_i\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}\\partial_k f_i\r$$$$\r[\\nabla\\times\\vec{f}]_k\r=\\varepsilon_{kij}\\partial_i f_j\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}\\partial_i f_j\r$$ 2. Conjugate curl\r$$\r\\vec{f}\\times\\nabla\r=\\hat{u}_if_i\\times\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u_j}\\hat{u}_j\r=f_i\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u_j}\\hat{u}_i\\times\\hat{u}_j\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}f_i\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u_j}\\hat{u}_k\r$$순환 기호는 인덱스는 하나의 항에 대응된다.\n$$\r[\\vec{f}\\times\\nabla]_i\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}f_j\\partial_k\r$$$$\r[\\vec{f}\\times\\nabla]_j\r=\\varepsilon_{jki}f_k\\partial_i\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}f_k\\partial_i\r$$$$\r[\\vec{f}\\times\\nabla]_k\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}f_i\\partial_j\r$$ 3. High tensor curl\r중복 지수 규칙에 위배하지 않아야 함을 주의한다.\n$$\r\\nabla\\times\\bar{\\bar{A}}\r=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u_i}\\hat{u}_i\\times A_{jk}\\hat{u}_j\\hat{u}_k\r=\\frac{\\partial A_{jk}}{\\partial u_i}\\hat{u}_i\\times\\hat{u}_j\\hat{u}_k\r=\\frac{\\partial A_{jk}}{\\partial u_i}(\\hat{u}_i\\times\\hat{u}_j)\\hat{u}_k\r=\\varepsilon_{ijl}\\frac{\\partial A_{jk}}{\\partial u_i}\\hat{u}_l\\hat{u}_k\r$$순환 기호는 인덱스는 하나의 항에 대응된다. 그리고 각 항의 인덱스는 순환기호와 인접해야 한다.\n$$\r[\\nabla\\times\\bar{\\bar{A}}]_{lk}\r=\\varepsilon_{ijl}\\partial_i A_{jk}\r$$$$\r[\\nabla\\times\\bar{\\bar{A}}]_{il}\r=\\varepsilon_{jki}\\partial_j A_{kl}\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}\\partial_j A_{kl}\r$$ example1) $\\nabla\\times\\nabla f=0$ 임을 보여라.\nsol)\n$$\r\\nabla\\times\\nabla f\\implies\r\\varepsilon_{ijk}\\partial_j[\\nabla f]_k\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}\\partial_j\\partial_k f\r$$전개하면, 순환기호의 특성에 따라, 서로 상쇄된다. 따라서 0이다.\n4. High tensor conjugate curl\r$$\r\\bar{\\bar{A}}\\times\\nabla\r=A_{ij}\\hat{u}_i\\hat{u}_j\\times\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u_k}\\hat{u}_k\r=A_{ij}\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u_k}\\hat{u}_i(\\hat{u}_j\\times\\hat{u}_k)\r=\\varepsilon_{jkl}A_{ij}\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u_k}\\hat{u}_i\\hat{u}_l\r$$순환 기호는 인덱스는 하나의 항에 대응된다. 그리고 각 항의 인덱스는 순환기호와 인접해야 한다.\n$$\r[\\bar{\\bar{A}}\\times\\nabla]_{il}\r=\\varepsilon_{jkl}A_{ij}\\partial_k\r$$$$\r[\\bar{\\bar{A}}\\times\\nabla]_{ij}\r=\\varepsilon_{kli}A_{jk}\\partial_l\r=\\varepsilon_{ikl}A_{jk}\\partial_l\r$$",
    "description": "1. Curl\r$$\r\\nabla\\times\\vec{f}\r=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\vec{u}}\\times\\vec{f}\r=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u_i}\\hat{u}_i\\times f_j\\hat{u}_j\r=\\frac{\\partial f_j}{\\partial u_i}\\hat{u}_i\\times\\hat{u}_j\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}\\frac{\\partial f_j}{\\partial u_i}\\hat{u}_k\r$$순환 기호는 인덱스는 하나의 항에 대응된다.\n$$\r[\\nabla\\times\\vec{f}]_i\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}\\partial_j f_k\r$$$$\r[\\nabla\\times\\vec{f}]_j\r=\\varepsilon_{jki}\\partial_k f_i\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}\\partial_k f_i\r$$$$\r[\\nabla\\times\\vec{f}]_k\r=\\varepsilon_{kij}\\partial_i f_j\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}\\partial_i f_j\r$$ 2. Conjugate curl\r$$\r\\vec{f}\\times\\nabla\r=\\hat{u}_if_i\\times\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u_j}\\hat{u}_j\r=f_i\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u_j}\\hat{u}_i\\times\\hat{u}_j\r=\\varepsilon_{ijk}f_i\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u_j}\\hat{u}_k\r$$순환 기호는 인덱스는 하나의 항에 대응된다.",
